  "details": "This is a very recent bug and I'm not sure if it's an oculus bug or a vrchat bug, however, when I take off my headset to go afk, I always see my preview window on the computer flashing, which is not good. Anyone with epilepsy would be having a lot of trouble with this. This flashing does not occur when the headset is on, just when it's off my head.",
